# Eval audio tree. The /files root sets Options -Indexes for the site; re-enable browsing
# here so the run folders (control_runs/, renders/, riffer/) are navigable. The landing
# index.html serves for /files/evals/ itself; subfolders fall through to a file listing.
Options +Indexes
IndexOptions FancyIndexing HTMLTable NameWidth=* SuppressDescription FoldersFirst
DirectoryIndex index.html
AddType audio/mp4 .m4a
